# image-gen

Generate one image from a text prompt via MiniMax `image-01` model.

Set the MiniMax API key before running:

```bash
export MINIMAX_API_KEY="<your-api-key>"
```

## Usage

```bash
node .omp/skills/image-gen/scripts/image-gen.mjs "<prompt>" <width> <height> <output_filename>
```

| Argument | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| prompt | string | ≤ 1500 chars |
| width | int | 512–2048, multiple of 8 |
| height | int | 512–2048, multiple of 8 |
| output_filename | string | output path relative to cwd |

## Style keywords

- **Flat / UI / vector**: `UI style`, `flat illustration`, `vector art`, `minimalist`
- **Collage / cut-and-paste**: `paper cut collage`, `layered flat cut-out shapes`, `torn paper edges`
- **Vintage / retro**: `vintage paper collage`, `sun-faded tones`, `retro travel poster`
- **Photorealistic**: `photorealistic`, `documentary photography`, `film grain`
